raining agenda | Deferred | Training is outside this purchase packet and remains for separate follow-up. |\n+| Drone batteries for August documentation | Deferred | August media equipment is not part of the approved Phase 1 restock; related request R-105 is excluded. |\n+| Phase-two south-entrance signage plan | Deferred | Phase-two planning is outside the current packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope and deferred requests were not completed as part of the restock packet; no banner design, training agenda, media purchase decision, or phase-two signage plan is included here.\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+# North Shelter Phase 1 Restock — Operations Lead\n+\n+The recommended purchase includes **20 first aid refill kits ($480.00), 50 thermal blankets ($900.00), 12 LED lanterns ($420.00), and 15 water storage jugs ($330.00)**. All four are approved Phase 1 supplies, available in the requested quantities from their preferred vendors, and scheduled to arrive before the 2026-07-01 need-by date.\n+\n+**Total: $2,130.00.** The Phase 1 budget is $2,200.00, leaving **$70.00**.\n+\n+The logo welcome banner and drone battery set were excluded: the banner is a communications-category request, while the batteries are requested Phase 2 media equipment and not approved. The slogan/layout, volunteer training agenda, August media batteries, and phase-two signage work remain out of scope or deferred for separate follow-up; none was completed as part of this purchase packet.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@\n+# Phase 1 North Shelter Restock Purchase List\n+\n+Need-by date for the approved Phase 1 supplies: 2026-07-01. Budget: **$2,200.00**.\n+\n+| Request | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit cost | Line total | Preferred-vendor availability (selected items) |\n+|---|---|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | Yes | Approved Phase 1 medical supply; SafeAid has enough stock and delivers before need-by. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid: 25 available; delivery 2026-06-24 |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | Yes | Approved Phase 1 shelter supply; ShelterSource has enough stock and delivers before need-by. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource: 80 available; delivery 2026-06-25 |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | Yes | Approved Phase 1 power supply; BrightPath Supply has enough stock and delivers before need-by. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply: 20 available; delivery 2026-06-26 |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | No | Communications category is not eligible for the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. | 1 requested | $180.00 | — | Not selected; no purchase availability evaluation required. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | No | Phase 2, requested (not approved), and media category; it does not meet Phase 1 inclusion rules. | 3 requested | $95.00 | — | Not selected; no purchase availability evaluation required. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | Yes | Approved Phase 1 water supply; HydroMart has enough stock and delivers before need-by. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart: 20 available; delivery 2026-06-27 |\n+\n+**Selected-item total:** $2,130.00  \n+**Remaining budget:** $70.00 ($2,200.00 − $2,130.00)\n","additions":15,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@\n+# Scope Control — Phase 1 Purchase Packet\n+\n+## Core objective\n+\n+Select approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock supplies that fit within the $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date for the 2026-07-01 opening.\n+\n+## Inclusion rule\n+\n+Include a request only if it is Phase 1, approved, in the medical/shelter/power/water categories, deliverable by its need-by date from the preferred vendor, and the combined selection stays within budget. All eligible items are included when they fit the budget.\n+\n+## Secondary requests\n+\n+| Request | Disposition | Scope note |\n+|---|---|---|\n+| Communications slogan and logo welcome banner layout | Out of scope | Communications/design work is not a Phase 1 restock purchase. The banner request R-104 is excluded from the purchase list. |\n+| Volunteer shelter-intake training agenda | Deferred | Training is outside this purchase packet and remains for separate follow-up. |\n+| Drone batteries for August documentation | Deferred | August media equipment is not part of the approved Phase 1 restock; related request R-105 is excluded. |\n+| Phase-two south-entrance signage plan | Deferred | Phase-two planning is outside the current packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope and deferred requests were not completed as part of the restock packet; no banner design, training agenda, media purchase decision, or phase-two signage plan is included here.\n","additions":20,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+# North Shelter Phase 1 Restock — Operations Lead\n+\n+The recommended purchase includes **20 first aid refill kits ($480.00), 50 thermal blankets ($900.00), 12 LED lanterns ($420.00), and 15 water storage jugs ($330.00)**. All four are approved Phase 1 supplies, available in the requested quantities from their preferred vendors, and scheduled to arrive before the 2026-07-01 need-by date.\n+\n+**Total: $2,130.00.** The Phase 1 budget is $2,200.00, leaving **$70.00**.\n+\n+The logo welcome banner and drone battery set were excluded: the banner is a communications-category request, while the batteries are requested Phase 2 media equipment and not approved. The slogan/layout, volunteer training agenda, August media batteries, and phase-two signage work remain out of scope or deferred for separate follow-up; none was completed as part of this purchase packet.\n","additions":7,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","time":{"start":1790565095182,"end":1790565095191}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03f303881022c088016ab9dad2999087d2b6c88a03208757db"}},"id":"p