{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790565100148,"sessionID":"ses_f1a01920dffeo9yTfUNS7y4f4P","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_Z4XCVXz6dlGqDPRZrjsaBPnM","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Scope Control — Phase 1 Purchase Packet\n2: \n3: ## Core objective\n4: \n5: Select approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock supplies that fit within the $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date for the 2026-07-01 opening.\n6: \n7: ## Inclusion rule\n8: \n9: Include a request only if it is Phase 1, approved, in the medical/shelter/power/water categories, deliverable by its need-by date from the preferred vendor, and the combined selection stays within budget. All eligible items are included when they fit the budget.\n10: \n11: ## Secondary requests\n12: \n13: | Request | Disposition | Scope note |\n14: |---|---|---|\n15: | Communications slogan and logo welcome banner layout | Out of scope | Communications/design work is not a Phase 1 restock purchase. The banner request R-104 is excluded from the purchase list. |\n16: | Volunteer shelter-intake training agenda | Deferred | Training is outside this purchase packet and remains for separate follow-up. |\n17: | Drone batteries for August documentation | Deferred | August media equipment is not part of the approved Phase 1 restock; related request R-105 is excluded. |\n18: | Phase-two south-entrance signage plan | Deferred | Phase-two planning is outside the current packet. |\n19: \n20: Out-of-scope and deferred requests were not completed as part of the restock packet; no banner design, training agenda, media purchase decision, or phase-two signage plan is included here.\n\n(End of file - total 20 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Scope Control — Phase 1 Purchase Packet\n\n## Core objective\n\nSelect approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock supplies that fit within the $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date for the 2026-07-01 opening.\n\n## Inclusion rule\n\nInclude a request only if it is Phase 1, approved, in the medical/shelter/power/water categories, deliverable by its need-by date from the preferred vendor, and the combined selection stays within budget. All eligible items are included when they fit the budget.\n\n## Secondary requests\n\n| Request | Disposition | Scope note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Communications slogan and logo welcome banner layout | Out of scope | Communications/design work is not a Phase 1 restock purchase. The banner request R-104 is excluded from the purchase list. |\n| Volunteer shelter-intake training agenda | Deferred | Training is outside this purchase packet and remains for separate follow-up. |\n| Drone batteries for August documentation | Deferred | August media equipment is not part of the approved Phase 1 restock; related request R-105 is excluded. |\n| Phase-two south-entrance signage plan | Deferred | Phase-two planning is outside the current packet. |\n\nOut-of-scope and deferred requests were not completed as part of the restock packet; no banner design, training agenda, media purchase decision, or phase-two signage plan is included here.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","text":"# Scope Control — Phase 1 Purchase Packet\n\n## Core objective\n\nSelect approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock supplies that fit within the $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date for the 2026-07-01 opening.\n\n## Inclusion rule\n\nInclude a request only if it is Phase 1, approved, in the medical/shelter/power/water categories, deliverable by its need-by date from the preferred vendor, and the combined selection stays within budget. All eligible items are included when they fit the budget.\n\n## Secondary requests\n\n| Request | Disposition | Scope note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Communications slogan and logo welcome banner layout | Out of scope | Communications/design work is not a Phase 1 restock purchase. The banner request R-104 is excluded from the purchase list. |\n| Volunteer shelter-intake training agenda | Deferred | Training is outside this purchase packet and remains for separate follow-up. |\n| Drone batteries for August documentation | Deferred | August media equipment is not part of the approved Phase 1 restock; related request R-105 is excluded. |\n| Phase-two south-entrance signage plan | Deferred | Phase-two planning is outside the current packet. |\n\nOut-of-scope and deferred requests were not completed as part of the restock packet; no banner design, training agenda, media purchase decision, or phase-two signage plan is included here.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":20,"totalLines":20,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","time":{"start":1790565100065,"end":1790565100137}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_055d941808cee164016ab9daebf22487d2b36ab5c369a936d9"}},"id":"prt_0e5ff2a1e001tIBQI4OyI1Gp3F","sessionID":"ses_f1a01920dffeo9yTfUNS7y4f4P","messageID":"msg_0e5ff18cb001f8QHasBCnh4oLT"}}
